All derived and publication data tables distributed with this repository are
released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0). This covers:

- The 54 pseudonymised participant-level derived beat-to-beat CSV files under
  data/beats/ (columns beat_idx, RRI_ms, SBP_mmHg, PAT_ms).
- The publication-approved source tables and aggregate expected outputs under
  expected_outputs/, including Supplementary Data 1-3.

The software and analysis source code in the surrounding repository (src/,
scripts/, tests/, preprocessing_matlab/, synthetic_fixtures/, and top-level
LICENSE) is separately licensed under the MIT License. The two licenses apply
to distinct file classes: derived data tables are CC BY 4.0 and are not
covered by MIT.

